@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
title 充电桩状态图

state "空闲" as IDLE
state "使用中" as CHARGING
state "故障" as FAULT

[*] --> IDLE : 系统初始化
IDLE --> CHARGING : 用户启动充电
CHARGING --> IDLE : 结束充电/扣费完成
CHARGING --> IDLE : 管理员强制结束充电
CHARGING --> FAULT : 扣费失败/异常中断
IDLE --> FAULT : 提交故障报修
FAULT --> IDLE : 报修处理完成

note bottom of IDLE : 桩可用
note bottom of CHARGING : 正在充电
note bottom of FAULT : 需维修处理

note right of CHARGING : 欠费状态由 charge_records.deduction_status 跟踪\n充电桩仅维护 IDLE / CHARGING / FAULT 三种物理状态
@enduml